<title>USA: Cambrex says MacMillan named CFO.</title>
<headline>Cambrex says MacMillan named CFO.</headline>
<dateline>EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cambrex Corp said Tuesday Douglas MacMillan has joined the company as vice president and chief financial officer, effective April 14.</p>
<p>MacMillan was most recently vice president and chief financial officer for Morgan Products Ltd.</p>
<p>Cambrex is a chemical manufacturer.</p>
